.DS_Store

# Full-resolution originals are kept OUT of the repository; only the generated
# web sizes are committed.
#
# The whitelist below names the exact sizes tools/mkweb.sh produces (600px
# thumbnail, then the 1000/1600/2800 ladder). It is deliberately NOT a generic
# `*-[0-9]*x[0-9]*.jpg` pattern: that also matches full-resolution exports such
# as `IMG_1234-6000x4000.jpg`, which is how the original fotopage repository
# grew a 374 MB history.
#
# If you change LADDER or THUMB_LONG in tools/mkweb.sh, update this list too --
# in BOTH orientations, because the long edge lands in either position. The
# script fails loudly if it writes a file this list would exclude.
assets/photography/**
!assets/photography/**/
!assets/photography/**/*-thumbnail.jpg
!assets/photography/**/*-600x[0-9]*.jpg
!assets/photography/**/*-[0-9]*x600.jpg
!assets/photography/**/*-1000x[0-9]*.jpg
!assets/photography/**/*-[0-9]*x1000.jpg
!assets/photography/**/*-1600x[0-9]*.jpg
!assets/photography/**/*-[0-9]*x1600.jpg
!assets/photography/**/*-2800x[0-9]*.jpg
!assets/photography/**/*-[0-9]*x2800.jpg
